[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0938","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0938.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0781","title":"Computer Associates ARCServeIT Client Agent 本地代码执行漏洞","description":"CA ARCServeIT Client Agent 6.62 的 uagentsetup 组件存在临时文件权限检查缺陷，该组件在将临时文件移动至 agent.cfg 配置文件前未验证文件存在性与所有权，导致本地攻击者可通过在移动操作前篡改临时文件内容，实现任意命令执行并完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 ARCServeIT Client Agent 6.62 版本，攻击向量为本地，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，可造成机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0781"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28Z","remediation":"立即升级到 ARCServeIT Client Agent 6.62 的最新版本（或更高版本），以获取官方修复。临时文件应使用安全建立方式，如使用 `tmpfile()` 函数或在建立后立即验证其权限。强制要求临时文件必须由 root 所有者并具有严格的权限限制（如 0700）。部署时使用文件完整性监控工具，验证 agent.cfg 文件的哈希值。生产环境中应禁用对临时目录的写访问权限，并应用 AppArmor/SELinux 安全策略以限制命令执行。定期备份配置，并在更新后验证备份的完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0431.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1519","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5023","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0781","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a27c62772ea5fd76d872ecc75532da5c81d4b7c3/2000/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0781.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0781.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0781.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0938.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0935","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0935.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0779","title":"CheckPoint Firewall-1 安全绕过漏洞","description":"CheckPoint Firewall-1存在安全绕过漏洞，当启用RSH/REXEC设置时，其访问控制机制出现缺陷。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的连接请求，绕过访问限制，直接连接到RSH/REXEC客户端。该漏洞影响CheckPoint Firewall-1产品，CVSS评分7.5，威胁等级为中危，攻击条件较低。该漏洞可导致攻击者获取系统控制权，窃取敏感数据，或进一步渗透内部网络。该漏洞影响产品包括Firewal1的相关版本，以及依赖RSH/REXEC服务的网络设备。该漏洞已在微软2024年8月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0779"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27Z","remediation":"立即在 Checkpoint Firewall-1 管理控制台禁用 RSH/REXEC 服务设置，或升级至 FireWall-1 4.1 SP6 及以上修复版本；若无法立即升级，请在防火墙规则中显式拒绝 TCP 514/513 端口的 RSH/REXEC 连接请求，并在边界防火墙层面阻断此类恶意连接请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#Improper_stderr","http://www.osvdb.org/1487","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1534","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0779.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0779.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0779","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0779.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0779.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/32432109ff9e86b2bb98b1a1db62e571ca6165c8/2000/CVE-2000-0779.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0779.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0779.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0779.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0779.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0935.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0934","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0934.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0777","title":"Microsoft Money 密码泄漏漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Microsoft Money 密码保护功能存在明文存储密码的漏洞，攻击者若能获得对系统的物理访问权限，即可读取存储的明文密码，导致敏感财务信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Money 相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/完全机密性/完整性/可用性影响）。攻击者需具备物理访问权限，通过读取存储文件获取明文密码，进而窃取用户财务数据。微软已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0777"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Microsoft Money 10.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了密码明文存储问题。如无法立即升级，建议禁用无需密码即可访问 Money 的功能，并使用复杂的账户密码，避免物理访问者利用此漏洞获取 sensitive 数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1615","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-061","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0777.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0777.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0777","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0777.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0777.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0777.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f52f1c038fbedc0ce9132a21fb74a8989887ee3/2000/CVE-2000-0777.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/9413a774aa3c18bbfa82e1c5748c45ab31f77f67/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0777.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0777.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0777.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0934.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0927","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0927.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0774","title":"Bajie Webserver 路径泄露漏洞","description":"Bajie HTTP web服务器0.30a版本存在安全漏洞，其内置的\"test\" Java样板Servlet会意外泄露真实Web文档根目录路径信息。这允许攻击者无需身份验证即可获取服务器文件系统的内部结构，潜在泄露敏感文件或系统信息。攻击者通过简单的HTTP请求即可触发该漏洞，使服务器返回敏感路径，导致网站信息暴露，危及系统安全。该漏洞影响Bajie HTTP web服务器0.30a版本，可通过向服务器发送特定请求触发信息披露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0774"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27Z","remediation":"立即升级到Bajie Webserver 1.0+版本或更高版本以修复路径泄露漏洞。如果无法立即更新，建议通过修改web.xml文件禁用\"test\"servlet，并限制servlet权限至最小化原则，以防止攻击者访问真实目录信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0426.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1521","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0774.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0774.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0774","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0774.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0774.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0774.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/222954883eac531d34db516e19e6577028728292/2000/CVE-2000-0774.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0774.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0774.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0774.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0927.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0927.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0925","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0925.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0773","title":"Bajie HTTP Web Server 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Bajie HTTP Web Server 0.30a 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过构造包含 \"....\"（四个点）的特制 URL 绕过路径限制，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞利用 \"....\" 作为 \"..\" 目录遍历的变体，突破服务器的路径规范化检查，可读取服务器文件系统中的敏感文件（如配置文件、源代码、密码文件等）。攻击条件为：目标运行 Bajie HTTP Web Server 0.30a，攻击者可通过网络直接访问 Web 服务，无需身份认证即可发起攻击。CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），属于中危漏洞，主要影响机密性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0773"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Bajie HTTP web server 0.30a 并迁移至现代维护的 Web 服务器（如 Apache Tomcat、Jetty、Nginx 等）。若必须继续使用，请在 Web 服务器前部署 WAF 或反向代理（如 Nginx），配置规则拦截包含 \"....\"、\"..%2f\"、\"..%5c\" 等目录遍历序列的请求路径；同时在应用层实施路径规范化校验，规范化路径后校验是否在 Web 根目录下，禁止访问 Web 根目录外文件。建议尽快完成迁移，因该软件已于 2000 年停止维护，无官方补丁可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0426.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1522","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5021","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0773.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0773.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0773","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0773.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0773.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0773.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/28fa1bc56eb946581b4954ed0068b7aeb55be6e9/2000/CVE-2000-0773.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0773.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0773.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0773.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0925.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0925.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0923","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0923.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0772","title":"Tumbleweed MMS 默认账号无密码漏洞","description":"Tumbleweed Messaging Management System (MMS) 4.6 及更早版本（原名 Worldtalk Worldsecure）在安装过程中存在严重的默认口令漏洞：系统安装时会自动创建一个默认管理员账户 \"sa\" 且密码为空。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络远程直接使用该空密码账户登录系统管理界面，获得完全的管理员权限。该漏洞影响所有安装了受影响版本 MMS 的系统，攻击条件极低（远程访问、无需认证、低攻击复杂度），CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于高危漏洞。攻击者利用该漏洞可完全控制消息管理系统，窃取敏感通信数据、篡改消息路由、植入后门等，严重威胁企业通信安全。建议立即升级至修复版本并修改默认账户密码，或禁用/删除默认 \"sa\" 账户。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0772"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Tumbleweed MMS 至 4.6 之后的修复版本（建议升级至最新版本），并立即修改默认 \"sa\" 账户密码为强密码（至少 12 位含大小写数字特殊字符）。如无法立即升级，请立即禁用或重命名默认 \"sa\" 账户，并在防火墙层面限制 MMS 管理端口（默认 80/443/8080）仅允许可信 IP 访问。同时配置强密码策略并启用账户锁定策略防止暴力破解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0098.html","http://thompson.tumbleweed.com/NewKB/bulletin/UPFiles/sa-official.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1562","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0772","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a91b5761c0d412dd56f3e255388077228a3d8a70/2000/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0772.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0772.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0772.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0923.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0923.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0923.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0922","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0922.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0771","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 本地安全策略损坏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 存在本地安全策略损坏漏洞，本地用户可通过发送畸形 RPC 流量破坏本地安全策略，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 RPC 处理逻辑未正确验证输入数据，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且无需认证即可发送畸形 RPC 流量触发漏洞，导致本地安全策略损坏，引发系统服务拒绝服务。影响 Windows 2000 系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，属于本地拒绝服务漏洞，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，仅影响系统可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0771"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26Z","remediation":"建议升级至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019/2022）。若必须维持 Windows 2000，请安装微软发布的 MS00-067 补丁（KB271823），并在防火墙层面封锁本地 135/445 端口 RPC 通信作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1613","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-062","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0771","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a91b5761c0d412dd56f3e255388077228a3d8a70/2000/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0771.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0771.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0771.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0922.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0920","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0920.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0770","title":"微软 IIS 文件权限绕过漏洞","description":"互联网信息服务（IIS）4.0 和 5.0 存在文件权限规范化漏洞，该漏洞源于服务器在处理文件路径时未能正确应用权限验证规则。攻击者无需认证即可向目标IIS服务器发送特制的文件请求，通过利用不同路径表示方式（如相对路径、绝对路径和符号链接）绕过正常的权限检查机制，从而访问原本受限制的文件资源。该漏洞影响广泛，支持IIS 4.0和5.0的Web服务器，其中关键配置文件、应用程序数据和敏感系统文件容易受到威胁。攻击者通过构造特殊的HTTP请求或文件操作，直接获取或修改服务器上的机密文件，窃取网站配置信息和用户数据。漏洞CVSS评分6.4，表明其安全性等级为中等级，需立即修复以确保Web应用的安全性和可用性。微软已在后续版本中修复了该漏洞，建议用户升级到支持微软安全更新的IIS版本或应用最新的安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0770"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-057 发布的补丁，IIS 4.0 用户从 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=344BFA19-F565-410E-8A9A-8BCBF3AAAABD 下载，IIS 5.0 用户从 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=4BF55FCC-F417-41D4-8E91-AE0832A0BC8E 下载。安装前请先备份 IIS 配置文件和网站数据。安装后重启 IIS 服务使补丁生效，并通过 KB 文章 Q269862（https://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb;en-us;269862）验证补丁是否已正确应用。同时检查所有虚拟目录配置，确保 Web 文件夹结构不直接镜像服务器物理文件系统路径，以降低被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1565","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-057","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0770","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d226694fb3655325d703aa542069be1356d5a679/2000/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0770.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0770.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0770.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0920.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0920.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0917","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0917.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0769","title":"O'Reilly WebSite Pro 任意文件上传与执行漏洞","description":"O'Reilly WebSite Pro 2.3.7 版本在安装时将 uploader.exe 程序赋予所有用户执行权限，导致远程攻击者可直接调用该程序创建并执行任意文件。该漏洞源于安装程序未正确配置文件权限，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程调用 uploader.exe 上传并执行恶意文件，可导致服务器完全沦陷。影响 O'Reilly WebSite Pro 2.3.7 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，可造成机密性、完整性、可用性部分影响。攻击者仅需向服务器发送针对 uploader.exe 的请求即可实现任意文件上传与执行，建议升级至修复版本或限制 uploader.exe 执行权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0769"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 O'Reilly WebSite Pro 2.5 或更高版本（官方已发布修复补丁，参考 SecurityFocus BID 1611 供应商公告），或迁移至 IIS/Apache/Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器。若无法立即升级，请立即执行以下缓解措施：1) 删除或重命名 WebSite Pro 安装目录下的 uploader.exe 文件；2) 在 Web 服务器配置中禁止对 uploader.exe 的所有 HTTP 请求访问；3) 使用文件系统 ACL 移除 Everyone 用户对 uploader.exe 的执行权限（仅保留 SYSTEM/Administrators 读取）；4) 在防火墙/WAF 层面拦截针对 /uploader.exe 路径的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96715834610888&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1611","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0769","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7d8bf94237358a026e3c7caf39c1fffcde5864d7/2000/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0769.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0769.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0769.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0917.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0917.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0917.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0915","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0915.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0767","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Scriptlet 渲染任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 版本中用于调用脚本小程序（Scriptlet）的 ActiveX 控件存在任意文件读取漏洞。该控件在处理 HTML 渲染时未能正确限制文件类型，导致可读取非 HTML 格式的任意文件内容。攻击者可通过诱使用户访问特制网页，利用该 ActiveX 控件读取目标系统上的任意文件（如本地配置文件、敏感文档等），造成信息泄露。攻击条件要求用户使用受影响版本 IE 并访问恶意构造的页面，利用方式简单，危害中等。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0767"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft Security Bulletin MS00-055 对应补丁，升级 Internet Explorer 至 5.01 SP2 或 5.5 SP1 及以上版本。如无法升级，可在 IE 安全设置中将「ActiveX 控件和插件」相关选项禁用，或使用现代浏览器替代。由于 IE 4.x/5.x 已停止支持，推荐升级至受支持的操作系统及浏览器版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1564","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-055","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0767","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0aa53285166fed6b300b29cf483b59e9c54d85d6/2000/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0767.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0767.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0767.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0915.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0915.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0915.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0913","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0913.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0765","title":"Microsoft Office 2000 HTML对象标签缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 2000 的 HTML 解释器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过在 HTML 文档中嵌入超长的 object 对象标签触发该溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Word 2000、Excel 2000 及 PowerPoint 2000 等办公套件组件。当用户使用受影响版本的 Office 打开包含恶意构造 HTML 内容的文档时，HTML 解释器因未对 object 标签长度进行充分边界检查而导致缓冲区溢出，攻击者可借此获得与当前用户同等权限的远程代码执行能力，进而进一步读取敏感数据、篡改文件或控制系统。该漏洞无需身份认证即可通过网络进行远程利用，利用需攻击者诱使用户打开特制文档。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-056 中发布补丁以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0765"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Office 2000 升级至 Office 2000 Service Pack 3 (SP3)，该补丁修复了 HTML 解释器中的对象标签缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Office 应用程序中禁用 HTML 对象标签的自动解析功能，通过注册表设置 HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Office\\9.0\\Common\\Security\\DisableHTMLObjectTag 值为 1 作为临时缓解措施，并禁止打开来源不明的 Office 文档。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1561","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-056","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/28e8ce8af73241917321442d8cbe49ad874668a1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5518e115c47ce67fd19a448733cb6cb562e79960/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0765","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6ac8a9b890bb6406909f4f8a26f9c6dd683fab7d/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/057597701bfc06dad57f37469c3e617686f396ff/2000/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/045d91bab22c89704c15e2e4c2a2733e1e9a5329/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0765.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0765.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0765.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0913.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0911","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0911.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0764","title":"Intel Express 500 系列交换机畸形IP数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Intel Express 500 系列交换机在 IP 数据包处理逻辑中存在缺陷，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可向目标设备发送特制畸形 IP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致交换机拒绝服务、网络服务中断。该漏洞影响运行 2.63 和 2.64 版本的 Intel Express 500 系列交换机，攻击者可利用该缺陷使目标设备停止转发数据包，进而导致整个网络的可用性受到严重影响。攻击条件极为宽松，攻击者仅需通过网络向目标交换机发送畸形 IP 数据包即可完成攻击，无需任何凭证或特殊权限，危害等级为中等，CVSS v2 评分 5.0。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0764"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25Z","remediation":"联系 Intel 获取 Express 500 系列交换机固件修复版本并升级到已修复此问题的更新版本（高于 2.64），修复该漏洞后畸形 IP 报文将不再导致交换机瘫痪。如暂时无法获得固件更新，建议在网络边界部署入侵检测系统（IDS）或防火墙规则，过滤含有畸形 IP 选项或异常长度的入站数据包，以阻止攻击者向交换机发送恶意构造报文。同时定期查阅 Intel 安全公告获取补丁发布信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0338.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1609","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5154","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/761c156ad3eda85b7d2b67fee400e658dfbee229/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/47ec74f5faf5543ca791f6a1af1c075a0176bd75/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0764","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/587bea69d167e460a23a9be6f3ca8e8e579b31db/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/90636c5eb0ebf4fb8d7f6d8c1464f65a217dc73b/2000/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/cf33bcd8c9c3dd9716057ebbaa91c4242d5c116d/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0764.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0764.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0764.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0911.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0909","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0359","title":"thttpd If-Modified-Since 头缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"THTTPd（Trivial HTTP Server）在处理 HTTP 请求头时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 If-Modified-Since 请求头，即可触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃造成拒绝服务，或进一步执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 THTTPd 2.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至最新版本或限制对 THTTPd 服务的网络访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0359"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33Z","remediation":"升级 thttpd 至 2.21 或更高版本，该版本修复了 If-Modified-Since 头处理中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截长度超过 1024 字节的 If-Modified-Since 请求头作为临时缓解措施。对于仍在运行旧版 thttpd 的生产环境，建议迁移至 actively maintained 的 HTTP 服务器（如 Nginx 或 Apache）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/1626.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_30.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1248","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0359.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0359.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0359","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0359.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0359.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mrrh-jg5h-m3rp/GHSA-mrrh-jg5h-m3rp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0359.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0909.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0909.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0909.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0904","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0904.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0761","title":"IBM OS/2 FTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM OS/2 Warp 4.5（及 4.0/4.2/4.3 版本）的 FTP 服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞。其原理是服务器在处理用户登录请求时，未能对输入用户名的长度进行有效校验，导致远程攻击者可以通过发送一个超长的用户名字符串触发缓冲区溢出或系统异常。该漏洞影响所有运行相关版本 FTP 服务的系统，攻击者无需任何身份认证，仅需在网络可达条件下发送特制请求即可导致 FTP 服务崩溃并停止响应，造成远程拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0761"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25Z","remediation":"建议停止使用受影响的 OS/2 Warp 内置 FTP 服务器，迁移至更安全的第三方 FTP 软件。若必须保留，请在防火墙上限制 FTP 访问权限，仅允许可信 IP 连接，或通过入侵检测系统（IDS）拦截超长用户名的恶意请求以防止拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0166.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/093c5941fc87f5111705731d4067bd31fc64fcb1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0761","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/69f765b890d6a7ba9619723b83004b4c02c80271/2000/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/587bea69d167e460a23a9be6f3ca8e8e579b31db/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f70d5f67d882c6b7234765d7d282f3eabd0bde73/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0761.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0761.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0761.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0904.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0903","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0903.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0758","title":"Lyris List Manager 权限提升漏洞","description":"Lyris List Manager 3 和 4 版本的 Web 界面存在权限校验漏洞。由于程序未能对隐藏表单字段进行有效的服务器端验证，攻击者（订阅用户）可以通过修改 HTTP 请求中 `list_admin` 隐藏字段的值，绕过身份验证直接获取管理级访问权限。该漏洞影响 Lyris List Manager 3 及 4 版本，攻击者无需管理员凭据，仅需通过篡改表单参数即可实现越权管理，导致系统配置被非法修改或敏感数据泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0758"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25Z","remediation":"建议将 Lyris List Manager 升级至 4.0 版本以上。若无法立即升级，应在 Web 服务器端部署 WAF 规则，拦截并过滤包含非法修改 list_admin 字段的 POST 请求，或通过自定义脚本在服务端强制校验用户订阅权限与管理员权限的对应关系。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0149.html","http://www.lyris.com/lm/lm_updates.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1584","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0758.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0758.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0758","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0758.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0758.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ea90c7fc25f5e69e4136f9e85f28f432820c894/2000/CVE-2000-0758.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/n